Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.16,0:00:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,自人类文明伊始，娃娃便深受孩子喜爱
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,为收藏者所珍视，以及在宗教仪式中作为连接善恶的渠道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.78,0:02:19.84,Title,0,0,0,0,,《安娜贝尔》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.77,0:02:24.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣莫尼卡 加州 一年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.11,0:35:19.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加州 帕萨迪纳）
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.38,1:31:59.09,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.71,1:34:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,安娜贝尔如今被装进了一个玻璃盒
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.00,1:34:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放置在艾德和洛林·华伦的艺术品收藏室内
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.00,1:34:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个月会请牧师来净化两次
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.19,1:34:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,邪恶的威胁向来存在…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:19.00,1:34:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们提高警惕，便可加以控制，但永远无法真正将其消灭
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.90,0:00:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,光是想就让我们害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}It scares us just thinking about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:01:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听了之后肯定会觉得我们疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you hear it you're gonna think we're insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.63,0:01:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚开始都是小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started out small, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.07,0:01:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,像是一只手或是一条腿 变了方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like a leg or a hand was in a different position and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.12,0:01:09.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是它的头朝上看 而不是向下\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's head was looking up instead of down and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着有一天 就是出现在完全不同的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one day it was in a completely different room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.70,0:01:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它自己动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moving around by itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.96,0:01:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡米拉找了灵媒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Camilla got in touch with a medium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.17,0:01:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说娃娃被一个叫安娜贝尔·希金斯的女孩附身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We learned from her that the doll was possessed by a girl named Annabelle Higgins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.21,0:01:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她失去了双亲 喜欢上了我的娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}She had lost her parents and had taken a liking to my doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是想做朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}All she wanted was to be friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.92,0:01:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听了之后 觉得很同情她\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we heard this we felt really sorry for her I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.99,0:01:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是护士 就是帮助他人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're nurses We help people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.61,0:01:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,可之后…情况就变坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then… Things got worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么得到它的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you end up with it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.74,0:01:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是妈妈送我的生日礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift from my mom for my birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.32,0:01:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道她是哪里来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where she got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.30,0:01:50.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…我们害怕极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… We are beyond terrified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝重视牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}God honour sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.34,0:02:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的牺牲会打动上帝的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our sacrifices touch god's heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.44,0:02:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,感动他的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And move his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣说 这是我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus said: This is my commandment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,像我爱你般爱彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you love one another as I have loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:46.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比这更伟大的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greater love hath no-one than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,为朋友舍命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he lay down his life for his friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.07,0:02:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们来祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.05,0:03:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你 回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you too See you soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.27,0:03:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那…谁赢了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok So eh… Who won?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.22,0:03:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 不过他作弊\N{\fnArial\fs30}John But he cheats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我…是以一敌二啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I Ehh. It was two against one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不采取措施 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to do something right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.03,0:03:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah Right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.02,0:03:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎朗去哪儿了？ - 我们去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where did Sharon get off to? - We'll find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮特让你来找我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pete send you after me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.39,0:03:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说 有天他会以为我也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear one day he thinks I'll just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.13,0:04:00.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一跑了之\N{\fnArial\fs30}run off too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,男人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了我们 他们可怎么活？说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would they be without us? I mean honestly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 最后的演讲很精彩 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We appreciate the last speech. - Sure thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.87,0:04:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你务必代我们照顾好这位太太和宝宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just make sure to take care of this wife and baby for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.98,0:04:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有问过名字了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we ask about names yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 莎朗 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sharon! - What?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.90,0:04:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是八卦 就是聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not prying It's just conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.08,0:04:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还在琢磨呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still working on them anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我们基本肯定 约翰 如果是男孩的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're pretty sure… John if it's a boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.83,0:04:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩就叫菲丽丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're thinking Phyllis if it's a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？ - 是啊 你说你喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were? - Yeah You said you liked it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.12,0:04:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可没说过 - 是我祖母的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He I never said that. - It's my grandmother's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我受不了你祖母 - 哎哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I can't stand your grandmother. - Oh dear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.75,0:04:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是我 根本没人受得了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not only me I mean nobody can stand her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.02,0:04:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她说得没错 大家都讨厌她\N{\fnArial\fs30}No she's right Everyone hates her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.32,0:05:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 说到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok Well… On that note Sharon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.93,0:05:05.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们进去吧 这两位需要好好谈一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go inside These two they have a lot to talk about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.29,0:05:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you and… - Think nothing of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.16,0:05:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住…孩子是恩赐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just remember… children are a blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.84,0:05:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,确实是 然后他们学会了讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed they are. And then they learn to talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.03,0:05:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你不同意叫「菲丽丝」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's a no on Phyllis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不该当着他们的面聊太多宝宝的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shouldn't talk about the baby so much in front of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.35,0:05:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那样不好 - 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It just aint right. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.00,0:05:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们两年前才失去了女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well they only lost their daughter two years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.37,0:05:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去了女儿？米娅？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose their daughter? Mia?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.62,0:05:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是离家出走 加入了嬉皮士\N{\fnArial\fs30}She ran away and joined up with the hippies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.08,0:05:41.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在估计已经有三个老公 改名叫「星星」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By now she's probably got three husbands and calls herself Star.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是叫「星星」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… "Even Star"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也比菲丽丝好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a better name than Phyllis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你没锁门？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… you didn't lock it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没啊 干嘛要锁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Why would I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.30,0:05:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得开始记得锁门了 约翰 现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to start locking it John I mean it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.23,0:05:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a different world now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.35,0:06:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自称为「家族」\N{\fnArial\fs30}They call themselves "The Family".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.77,0:06:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但警方将其定性为危险的邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}But police officials have labelled them a dangerous cult{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.97,0:06:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,居住在施潘牧场内\N{\fnArial\fs30}residing on the grounds of Spahn Ranch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.36,0:06:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里曾作为很多著名西部片的背景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once used as the backdrop for many well-known westerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.93,0:06:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,「家族」 估计有将近三十名成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Family is estimated to have close to thirty gatherers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中很多都有大量药物史和犯罪行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Many of them with histories of heavy drug use and criminal behaviour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.63,0:06:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前正被拘留 等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are in custody awaiting charges…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,残忍杀害泰特和拉比安卡一案的起诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the brutal Tate and LaBianca murders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们使得洛杉矶人心惶惶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They held Los Angeles in the grip of fear…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.02,0:06:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,在警探掌握嫌犯线索之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}before police investigators were led to the suspects…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.18,0:06:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 能关掉电视吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey Honey?! Do you think you could shut off the TV?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得我有点难以集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's making it a little hard to concentrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.14,0:06:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的领导者 查理斯·曼森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their leader Charles Manson was sometimes referred to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.20,0:06:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,被他的追随者视为上帝和撒旦的化身\N{\fnArial\fs30}as both God and Satan by his devoted followers…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.82,0:06:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,并预言有「世界末日」般的事件发生 称之为「混乱游戏」\N{\fnArial\fs30}had predicted an Armageddon like event he called Helter Skelter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.30,0:06:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.90,0:06:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 听我说 你不该看这种东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, u know. You shouldn't even be watching that stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 可能会令宝宝不安的 有新的研究显示…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright It could upset the baby. There's new research out there…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.73,0:07:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哎哟 又有新研究啊 - 是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh boy! More new research? - It's true!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.28,0:07:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现宝宝在子宫内\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are learning that the babies in utero{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.18,0:07:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对外面世界的感知 要超出人们的想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}experience more of the outside world than they ever thought possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.15,0:07:11.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们懂得识别声音和噪音 歌曲\N{\fnArial\fs30}They recognize voices and noises Songs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.60,0:07:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定研究这个的人花了好几百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I bet the man that did that research spent millions of dollars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.67,0:07:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明只要免费问自己老妈就可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they could have just asked the mother for free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.01,0:07:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这边怎么样？ - 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How's it going in here? - Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.06,0:07:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在尽全力投入进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am trying my hardest to enjoy it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都在跟我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone keeps telling me that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.64,0:07:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要开始实习 事情就会更加难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you're in the residency it gets a million times worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没提过我是个准爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't even mentioned the fact that I'm about to be a new father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.79,0:07:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么？ - 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.13,0:07:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时就是不想听人说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you just don't wanna hear how difficult…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会有多难 - 难？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's gonna be. - Difficult?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.35,0:07:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 或许说「难」不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know Maybe difficuIt's not the right word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.09,0:07:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑战\N{\fnArial\fs30}Challenging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.65,0:07:59.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说实习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you talking about the residency{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我和宝宝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}or me and the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.41,0:08:03.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.84,0:08:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想是全部吧 我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of it I guess I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.05,0:08:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼下对我来说并不是个理想的状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like this is an ideal situation for what I'm about to go through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.97,0:08:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我们…对我们来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I. We. We're about to go through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.69,0:08:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不是那个意思的 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't mean for that to sound like it did I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:37.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.07,0:08:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,困难 挑战 或是什么坏事儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}difficult or challenging or bad things anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.38,0:08:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.81,0:08:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that I've been a little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.15,0:08:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只顾忙自己的事 有人或许会说太自我中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}caught up in my own world lately Some people might call it self centered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.12,0:08:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人？ - 大多数人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some people? - Most people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.41,0:08:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.88,0:08:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能倒个带 过去两分钟重来一次吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just go back and redo the last two minutes please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.54,0:09:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.05,0:09:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.97,0:09:12.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你有压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you were stressed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是最近\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just a little{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:18.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点太敏感了\N{\fnArial\fs30}over sensitive lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想要我告诉你原因吗？ - 是的 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want me to tell you why? - Yes Doctor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.31,0:09:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎…专业的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}almost… expert opinion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:31.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有点敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a little sensitive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.11,0:09:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为你怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you are a lot pregnant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.56,0:09:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 很抱歉 我…我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey I'm sorry I mean… I am…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.74,0:09:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 医学院快毕业了 我压力有点大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes I'm. I'm stressed about finishing med-school{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.67,0:09:43.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点害怕竞争 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm freaking out about matching but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.03,0:09:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没这么幸福过 从没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been happier Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:51.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？那都是因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok? And that's because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有小家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.30,0:10:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有样东西我想给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something I wanna give you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.80,0:10:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别啊 上次你这么说 结果我被搞大肚子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no The last time you said that I ended up pregnant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.52,0:10:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.13,0:10:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok Close your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想等到宝宝出生 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting on this until the baby but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.82,0:10:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得有点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were feeling a little…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.58,0:10:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,内疚 是 因为是我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guilty yes Because of what I said.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:41.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 睁开眼睛吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok Open your eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:46.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 约翰 - 就是这个 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My god John. - That's the one right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.01,0:11:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.41,0:11:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪儿找到她的？我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you find her? I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.46,0:11:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道我找了多久吗？ - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you know how long I've been looking? - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.79,0:11:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都彻底放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had completely lost hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有我的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh I have my ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,未来几个月房租可能会比较紧张 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be a little short on the rent the next few of months but eh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.51,0:11:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 刚刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There She fits right in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.13,0:11:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这样一组就全了 是吧 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That completes the set-up right? - Yes It does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 我爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you I love her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？约翰 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}John? John Wake up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.11,0:13:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？是宝宝吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it? The baby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.98,0:13:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是 隔壁 我听到尖叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no Next door. I heard a scream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.93,0:13:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我觉得有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I think something's wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.76,0:13:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这儿 我去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay here I'm gonna check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.23,0:13:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 等下 我们不应该报警吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Wait Shouldn't we call the cops?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.84,0:13:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你觉得听到了尖叫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you think you heard a scream?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,先让我看看 换他们也会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me go check it out They'd do the same for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要是听到我叫 我宁愿他们立刻报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they heard me scream I'd rather they call the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.99,0:13:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是「认为」听到了你尖叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think they heard you scream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当心 - 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just be careful. - I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.47,0:14:33.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.89,0:14:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你浑身是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god! You're covered in blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的 快进去 马上叫救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not mine Go back inside and call an ambulance right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.43,0:15:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 911接线员 - 我…我需要救护车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 911 operator. - I need. I need an ambulance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.14,0:15:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,地址是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your location?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,园丁路307号\N{\fnArial\fs30}307 Gardener Road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.39,0:15:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 是什么紧急情况？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - What's your emergency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.04,0:15:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我不知道 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I. I don't know But…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot of blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.99,0:15:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,请尽快赶过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please Just be as fast as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的娃娃们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your dolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我丈夫马上就回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My. My husband's coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.40,0:16:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.41,0:16:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要什么就拿 赶紧走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take whatever you want Just. Just get out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去 快离开这里 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out Get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.08,0:17:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.04,0:17:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门 是警察 把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open up! It's the police! Open the door!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.70,0:18:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事 有我们在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alright We got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.43,0:18:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿 我就在你身边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right here I'm right here with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.81,0:18:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,据一名警探描述 这悲惨的一幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a tragic scene described by one investigator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,令人联想到可怕的邪教仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}as reminiscent of a horrific cult ritual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.22,0:18:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一对夫妻被残忍地捅死\N{\fnArial\fs30}A man and his wife was brutally stabbed to death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.78,0:18:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手便是他们离家出走的女儿安娜贝尔·希金斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}by their estranged daughter Annabelle Higgins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.18,0:18:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及不明身份的男友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her unidentified boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.28,0:18:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方认为这两人是邪教成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two are believed to be members of a cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.64,0:19:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方到达现场时 男性嫌犯已经中枪死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The male suspect was shot and killed as police arrived on scene.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.39,0:19:04.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,其女儿则看似是死于自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}While the daughter was found in an apparent suicide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.31,0:19:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喉咙被划开\N{\fnArial\fs30}her throat slit open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名警员对如此血腥谋杀的总结就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}One officer summed up these blood soaked murders by saying:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作多年 我从未见过如此可怕的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}In all my years I have never seen anything quite as gruesome as this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.36,0:19:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,羊膜肯定没有被刺穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn well the amniotic sac wasn't punctured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没有破裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And isn't ruptured.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.27,0:19:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,有受到压迫的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are seeing signs of strain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.34,0:19:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在颈部\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the cervix.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,多半是由于外部创伤造成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely caused by the trauma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.49,0:19:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.74,0:19:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让你孕期剩下的日子里都卧床休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am putting you on bed rest for the remainder of your pregnancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:39.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.60,0:19:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以起来去方便了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get up and use the facilities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.86,0:19:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你很敏感的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you do so delicately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.55,0:19:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但除此之外的任何事 都会让你和你的孩子有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But anything beyond that would be putting you and your child at risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alright?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.92,0:19:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you! - Ok.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.95,0:20:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.61,0:20:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让他们把每样东西都洗刷了 起码两遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had them scrub everything At least twice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,都可以在里面做手术 很干净的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can perform surgery in there It's so clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.05,0:20:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不用这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't have to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.77,0:20:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是不这样 卧床久了你会发疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're on bed rest for a while You'd go crazy if I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要沉迷于日间肥皂剧就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Don't get all obsessed with those daytime soaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.43,0:21:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我根本不喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I can't stand them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.04,0:21:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头我再把你的针线活拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bring your sewing back in later on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.68,0:21:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？我们可以把整间房变成你的血汗工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok? We can turn the whole room into your own little sweatshop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.10,0:21:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说孩子不会有事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think the baby is Ok?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.32,0:21:21.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝都不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby is not even aware of what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.34,0:21:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？因为我听说有个新的研究…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh really? Because I heard there's some new research that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.12,0:21:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也听到医生说的了 只要你听话 宝宝就不会有事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard the doctors. So if you listen to them the baby is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.32,0:21:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby is fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是孩子他妈 对吗？不好的话你肯定知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're its mother right? If it wasn't you would know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.02,0:21:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果真的出事呢？ - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if something does happen? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.06,0:21:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 会发生什么？ - 比如 我要生产的时候 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's gonna happen? - When… Like when I go into labor John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.27,0:21:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.73,0:21:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会选择保孩子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll save the baby over me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.66,0:21:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 我们得谈一下这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - We have to talk about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法接受宝宝有任何闪失\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean I can't have it If anything ever happened to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.58,0:22:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey promise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.84,0:22:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我你会保孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise me you'll save the baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.76,0:22:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah Yeah I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你知道吗？不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? It's gonna be okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:20.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都会好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna be fine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.94,0:23:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.35,0:24:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.43,0:24:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.27,0:25:13.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你朋友 你知道的 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your friend. You know that don't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.18,0:25:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是菲尔？ - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Phil? - Of course I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.48,0:25:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我有朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well then I have a friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.48,0:25:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.91,0:25:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚饭后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}After dinner…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.58,0:25:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}even dancing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.30,0:26:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天怎么样？ - 电视又坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How'd it go today? - TV went out again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.05,0:26:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.92,0:26:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是房间的关系 在小屋从来没有过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be that room It never did that in the den.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.18,0:26:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是什么东西啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.81,0:26:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我在商店随便买的几样东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a bunch of random stuff that I picked up at the store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.00,0:26:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,来给孕妇解馋的\N{\fnArial\fs30}To satisfy any pregnancy cravings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.85,0:26:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,有意思的是 我并没有想吃东西的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's funny I haven't really had any cravings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.41,0:26:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,泡菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pickles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.72,0:26:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你知道什么最配泡菜吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god you know what would go really well with Pickles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.25,0:26:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰·戈登 我们是天生一对儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Gordon We are meant to be together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.08,0:26:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道 就像芥末和泡菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I know Like Mustard and Pickles.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.11,0:27:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你今天有个很重要的会议 是吧 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you have that big meeting today? - Yeah I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.90,0:27:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为我很有希望留在亨廷顿纪念医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks I've got a real shot at Huntington memorial.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.93,0:27:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.77,0:27:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过是在帕萨迪纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in Pasadena though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.29,0:27:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,离海边很远 可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So further from the beach Okay with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.69,0:27:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,换换风景也挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change of view would be good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.09,0:27:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.44,0:27:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨克拉门托有个一天的会议 他认为我应该参加\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this one day conference in Sacramento that he thinks I should attend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.45,0:27:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我朝那个方向发展有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}That could help move things in that direction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.73,0:27:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,过几天要飞过去一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly up for a day in a few days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.72,0:27:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,就一两天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a couple of days?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.97,0:27:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.85,0:27:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得上床休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get you back to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.36,0:27:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不应该坐这么久的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't be sitting up this long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.14,0:27:48.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉金警探今天来电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Detective Clarkin called today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.13,0:27:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,说他这星期抽空想过来一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said he wanted to stop by at some point this week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.93,0:27:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都已经告诉他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already told him everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.03,0:27:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…更愿意忘记整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I'd rather just forget the whole thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.05,0:27:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 他只是说想再问几件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know He just said he wanted to go over a few things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.31,0:28:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.78,0:28:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得丢掉它 当时就抱在她手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get rid of it I mean she had it in her hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.61,0:28:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你是对的 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}No You're right You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.44,0:28:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就…放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just Consider it gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.86,0:28:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你可以告诉克拉金警探 他方便的话随时可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you can tell Detective Clarkin he can stop by whenever's convenient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.47,0:28:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正我一时半会儿哪也不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like I'm going anywhere anytime soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.59,0:28:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是邪教成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were members of a cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.49,0:28:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确认了是希金斯的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've confirmed that it was Higgins daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.18,0:29:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,和她男朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And her boyfriend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.81,0:29:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可能看过新闻了 - 邪教在统治全世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You may have heard on the news. - That cults are taking over the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.70,0:29:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没有他们所让你认为的那样普遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not quite as prevalent as they'd have you believe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.61,0:29:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕你很难说服我们相信这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have a hard time convincing us of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.38,0:29:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是信奉撒旦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they satanic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.63,0:29:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 她应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay She should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.38,0:29:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.18,0:29:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错 认为他们是对神秘学感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes it is It is believed they had interest in the occult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.24,0:29:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做是为了证明他们的皈依\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they did this to prove their devotion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.20,0:29:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,算是一种 为了表现暴力的暴力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A sort of. Violence for violence's sake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.18,0:29:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.38,0:29:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,疯子干疯事儿 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crazy people do crazy things Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.65,0:29:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's all this was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.00,0:29:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会再深入调查 看能有什么结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll dig a little deeper See what I can find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.94,0:29:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果有进一步结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I come up with anything further, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.74,0:29:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我会再… - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll reach anoth… - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.36,0:30:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.79,0:30:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 除非是关系到我们的安全 不然我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… Unless it has something to do with our safety I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.19,0:30:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想再听到任何有关的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather not hear any more about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.59,0:30:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.34,0:30:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 就这样 就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay! Hold it right right right there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.19,0:30:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 我去做爆米花\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you! - I'm making popcorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.83,0:30:44.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定宝宝可以吃这么多奶油 还有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure it's okay for the baby to have this much butter and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.06,0:31:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你感觉怎么样？ - 紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you feeling? - Well nervous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.37,0:31:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会爱上你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are gonna love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.33,0:31:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 我也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - I love you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.17,0:33:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了 别怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you I got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.49,0:34:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉我没有在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry that I wasn't here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.79,0:34:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 - 你身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so sorry - Behind you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.76,0:34:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝贺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.12,0:34:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是个女孩儿 - 这是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a girl. - This is my baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.38,0:34:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my gosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.97,0:34:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.93,0:34:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.62,0:34:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 丽娅 我是你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi Leah It's your daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.03,0:34:40.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧她啊 看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her Look at her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.50,0:34:44.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.46,0:34:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 火\N{\fnArial\fs30}John The fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.31,0:34:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 她很好 你也很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine. She's fine You're fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.93,0:34:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.42,0:34:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉这房子被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like the house is cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.32,0:35:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法再回到那里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never go back there again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.35,0:35:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做不到 现在有了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't Not with her now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.22,0:35:08.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远都不用再回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to Ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.04,0:36:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 亲爱的 准备好了吗？ - 现在随时…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey honey, you all set? - Any second now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.69,0:36:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.98,0:36:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.25,0:36:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得出去走走 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out more Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.90,0:36:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要迟到了 - 我们真的要去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We'll be late! - You really think we should go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.46,0:36:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅有点迷糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean Leah's being a little fuzzy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.64,0:36:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅 她没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia She's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.30,0:36:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 你们俩都需要离开这里 关在这里待太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok You both need to get out of here You've been cooped up in here too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.52,0:36:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know but it's…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.12,0:36:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快看 看啊 出去走走 外面多美 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look look Get outta here It's beautiful Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.24,0:36:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你需要 我也需要 丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on You need this I need this Leah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.48,0:36:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,她绝对需要多一些色彩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She could definitely use some color.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.66,0:36:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.07,0:36:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄点那什么…你怎么说的来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put some of that… What do you call it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.31,0:36:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,可可奶油牛奶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cocoa Butter Milk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.85,0:36:52.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给她涂点可可奶油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should just slap her with some Cocoa Butter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.00,0:36:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 我去 只要你别再念了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay okay! I will go as long as you stop talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.83,0:36:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.27,0:37:01.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 - 走啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go! - Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.31,0:37:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能让恐惧控制我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot let fear control us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.16,0:37:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为与上帝同行时 我们绝不孤单\N{\fnArial\fs30}For we are never truly alone when we walk with God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.13,0:37:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是否对一样事物了解越多 我们的恐惧就越少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it true that the more we know about something the less fear we have from it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.58,0:37:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要面对恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to face our fears{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.77,0:37:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能更了解恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to better understand them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.88,0:37:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要用一道亮光\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to shine a bright light…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.56,0:37:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,照射依赖于我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the monsters that feed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.62,0:37:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不安 焦虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our insecurities on our anxieties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.43,0:37:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及自我怀疑而生存的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on the doubt that we cast on ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.67,0:37:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要记住 对那些有信念的人来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to remember that for those who have faith{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.20,0:37:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,真理的人生是不朽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}this life of truth is everlasting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.62,0:38:01.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.82,0:38:03.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我给你的小家伙拍张照吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind if I take a picture of your little one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.05,0:38:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢把会众中最新成员的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like hang photos of the newest members of the congregation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.25,0:38:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,贴在来访公告板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the visitors bulletin board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.07,0:38:11.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah yes Sure Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.44,0:38:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 把她抱在你腿上\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no Hold her on your lap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.23,0:38:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不用连我一起拍的 - 当然需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh you don't need me in the photo. - Of course I do…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.83,0:38:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲比其他生灵更接近上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mothers are closer to God than any other living creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.33,0:38:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有她们可以分享上帝创造性的奇迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}For only they can share in God's creative miracle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.01,0:38:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uno dos tres.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.59,0:38:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 应该可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful! That should do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.88,0:38:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个礼拜日我都还能感受到希金斯夫妇的缺席\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still feel the Higgins' absence every Sunday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.23,0:38:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想肯定很… - 约翰在那儿 我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I imagine it must be dif. - There's… There's John I should go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.02,0:38:49.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有很多箱子要拆封\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still have a lot of boxes to unpack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.05,0:38:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well unfortunately I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.44,0:38:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有可以帮你的祷告式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a prayer to help you with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.59,0:38:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.77,0:38:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想有些事是要靠自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}guess there are some things we need to take care of ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.83,0:38:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.69,0:39:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.79,0:39:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩雷斯神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father Perez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.55,0:39:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这是最后一箱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think this is the last of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.85,0:39:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备开香槟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody pop the Champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.63,0:39:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.44,0:40:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 怎么会有那个的 我发誓我丢掉了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a sec How'd that get in there? I swear I threw it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.18,0:40:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.13,0:40:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是火灾之后弄混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things must have gotten mixed up after the fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.62,0:40:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 给我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Give her to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.79,0:40:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.19,0:40:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你送我的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave her to me as a gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.79,0:40:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,佩雷斯神父说我们要相信我们的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like Father Perez said we should celebrate our strength right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.76,0:40:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.49,0:40:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.26,0:40:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 刚刚好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There She fits right in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.61,0:42:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.35,0:42:38.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh sorry Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.31,0:42:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们也住在这儿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you live here too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.91,0:42:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们住在… - 别告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We live in… - Don't tell her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.99,0:42:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were not supposed to tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.93,0:42:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a stranger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.43,0:42:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是很好的规矩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a very good rule to have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.02,0:42:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的娃娃 我也有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your doll I have one just like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.78,0:43:00.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.52,0:43:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实不只一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.53,0:43:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是米娅 她是丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mia and this is Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.69,0:43:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.87,0:43:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是南… - 我说了别告诉她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Nan… - I said don't tell her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.47,0:43:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.93,0:43:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许有天我们可以成为朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one day we can all be friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.71,0:44:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是巴美拉的新住客 是不是 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're the new tenants at the Palmyra aren't you? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.62,0:44:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这个小家伙看什么都很新鲜吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose this little one is pretty much new to everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.09,0:44:18.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's adorable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.42,0:44:22.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…我是米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I. I'm Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.76,0:44:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙林 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evelyn. Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.65,0:44:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 这是我女儿最喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here This is my daughters favorite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.90,0:44:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许等丽娅大一点 她也会喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Leah will like it too when she's a little older.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.85,0:44:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,太有心了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very sweet Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.18,0:44:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 随时都欢迎你来 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well feel free to stop by any time. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.33,0:45:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看他们给你画了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what they drew for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.92,0:45:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到吗 是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? That's us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.58,0:45:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经交到朋友了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making friends already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.59,0:45:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,咱们锻炼锻炼身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we're getting a little exercise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.97,0:45:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.95,0:46:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要…找他们父母谈谈吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should we… Talk to their parents?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.23,0:46:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果丽娅做出这种事 我…我会想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Leah did something like this I would wanna know about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.11,0:46:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅肯定不会这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah would never do anything like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.53,0:46:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,画得一点都不好 瞧瞧这比例\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't even good I mean. Look at the proportions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.73,0:46:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.78,0:46:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 米娅 如果她这样 我也想知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes Mia. If she did I would wanna know too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.95,0:46:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 所以我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? So lets go…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.12,0:46:27.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们住在哪儿 自我介绍一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find out where they live Introduce ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.86,0:46:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不要小题大做 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But let's not make a big deal outta this Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.41,0:46:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又不是威胁什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like this is a threat or anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.94,0:46:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是小孩子过分夸张的想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just one kid with an overactive imagination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.24,0:46:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I… I know I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.75,0:46:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住 我们搬到这里是为了远离过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta remember that we moved here to get away from what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.11,0:46:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收拾了衣服 打包了家具\N{\fnArial\fs30}We packed up our clothes We packed up our furniture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.90,0:46:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有美好的回忆 但是恐惧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We packed up the good memories. But the fears?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.05,0:46:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,和焦虑？我们说好统统留在过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the anxieties? We promised to leave those behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.87,0:46:51.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是说起来那么容易的 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is not as easy as it sounds John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.64,0:47:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我很抱歉 好吗 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look. I'm sorry… Okay You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.00,0:47:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,明晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.14,0:47:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用加班 好吗 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have to work late okay so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.41,0:47:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我回家来 咱们坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say I come home We sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.34,0:47:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,享受一顿美餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a nice dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.18,0:47:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来一个…成年人之间的对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we have some… Adult conversation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.96,0:47:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.00,0:47:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.53,0:49:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.55,0:49:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.57,0:49:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.87,0:50:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有别人在这儿 只有你我 和丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't anyone here It's just you and me and Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.74,0:50:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I saw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.59,0:50:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是她… - 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was her… - Mia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.75,0:50:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了一些事 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are things happening that I. That I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.68,0:50:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我无法解释 - 什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That I can't explain. - What things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.00,0:50:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 你…你确定不是焦虑造成的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby… Are you sure they're not just manifestations of your anxiety?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.81,0:50:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,新妈妈常会经历产后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfectly normal for new mothers to experience postpartum…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.73,0:50:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是医生 不代表你什么都是专家 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that being a doctor doesn't make you an expert on everything right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.05,0:50:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们应该找人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we should talk to someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.24,0:51:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.31,0:51:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,心理医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shrink?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.94,0:51:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没疯 约翰 我没疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not crazy John I'm not crazy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.80,0:51:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说你疯了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying that you're crazy okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.40,0:51:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的也不是心理医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not talking about a shrink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.44,0:51:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就到教会来了 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we turn to the church Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.42,0:51:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父母就是这样 在他们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what my parents did when they…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.23,0:51:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇到难题的时候 并且对他们有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}hit a rough patch. And it worked for them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.13,0:51:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.22,0:51:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们俩遇到的并不只是一个小难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you two hit more than just a rough patch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.30,0:51:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在几个月时间里 你们经历了人生最可怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a matter of months you've experienced the very worst of life…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.19,0:51:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和最美好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the very best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.66,0:51:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此巨大的变动\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pendulum swing like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.09,0:51:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以撼动最坚实的基础\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's enough to shake even the strongest foundations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.18,0:51:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们熬过去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you survived.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.63,0:51:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反于努力忘记这次不好的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And instead of trying to forget this bad history…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.68,0:51:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们应该加以利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you should use it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.14,0:51:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为你们两个齐心协力是很强大的实例\N{\fnArial\fs30}as an example of how strong you two can be when united.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.05,0:52:02.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,经历过这种事你们并没有变得更软弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't come out the other side of something like this weaker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.67,0:52:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是更坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come out stronger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.73,0:52:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.37,0:52:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.92,0:52:25.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 米娅 是吧 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mia right? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.61,0:52:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当然记得丽娅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And of course I remember Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.01,0:52:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.07,0:52:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 约翰 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi John. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.42,0:52:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位就是伊芙林 约翰 我跟你提起书店的那位女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Evelyn Jones. From the bookstore I was telling you about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.97,0:52:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 是是 谢谢你送的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right yeah yeah… Thank you for the book.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.56,0:52:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我情不自禁啊 看到你家的姑娘们 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't help myself I saw your girls and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.96,0:52:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就觉得和她们相识已久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt like I had known them a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.78,0:52:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 一家三口要去哪儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So! Where's this beautiful family off to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.10,0:52:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是… - 我得去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh they're just… - I have to get to the hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.37,0:52:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天值夜班 - 我看是他干了坏事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They put me on the night shift. - I think he did something terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.20,0:52:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说我是得到嘉奖呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say that I'm being rewarded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.28,0:52:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 如果你们想在这附近转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. If you guys ever want a tour of the neighbourhood…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.17,0:52:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,请尽管打给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't hesitate to call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.04,0:53:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 祝你们今天愉快 - 拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Blessed day! - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.52,0:53:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也该走了 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should probably go too Good morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.92,0:58:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,来人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.43,0:58:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.55,0:59:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.51,0:59:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.01,1:00:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你来见我 - 没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you for meeting with me. - It's fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.23,1:00:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过接到你的电话我有点意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a little surprised to hear from you though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.61,1:00:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 上次我们讲话… - 我说我不想再知道任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Last time we spoke… - I said I didn't want to know any more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.53,1:00:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持…保持了一点距离 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having… Had a little distance I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.05,1:00:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识到我需要一个…一个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I realize I could use some… some closure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.91,1:00:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 有太多没有解答的问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean there… there's just to many unanswered questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.98,1:00:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.27,1:00:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带来了有关希金斯一案的资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought what I have on the Higgins case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.13,1:00:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是安娜贝尔 希金斯家的女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Annabelle there The Higgins girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.50,1:00:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,照片显然是在她加入邪教之前拍的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was clearly taken before she got caught up in the cult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你上次见到她是十分不同 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks a lot different than the last time you saw her doesn't she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.90,1:00:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她加入的邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cult that she was in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.69,1:00:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有进一步调查吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you look further into it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.14,1:00:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,具体查什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what specifically?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.02,1:00:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 他们的袭击肯定是有动机的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know There must have been some motive for their attacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.36,1:01:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 疯人干疯事儿 - 疯事儿 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Crazy people do crazy things… - Crazy things I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.88,1:01:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不认为自己疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't think they were crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.95,1:01:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to have had a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.44,1:01:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在进一步调查后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a little more digging…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.38,1:01:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确实发现他们的行为是有信仰的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did find that their act was in devotional.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.18,1:01:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That they were…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.94,1:01:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们其实是想召唤什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were actually trying to conjure something up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.57,1:01:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 恶魔 魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like… Like what? - The Devil. Demons…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.29,1:01:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,牙仙什么的 具体我并不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tooth-fairy I don't know specifically.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.18,1:01:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不过不重要 - 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It doesn't really matter any. - Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.21,1:01:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为整件事就是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well because this is all just a bunch of hocus pocus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.85,1:01:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.84,1:01:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.40,1:01:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人都是歹徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}These were miscreants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.85,1:01:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道他们是嗑了什么药\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were probably hopped up on god knows what.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.70,1:01:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们…看到…做出各种…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it made 'em… see and do all sorts of…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.13,1:02:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}terrible things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.19,1:02:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对你来说重要吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does this mean anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.45,1:02:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有听过一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you ever heard the expression…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.72,1:02:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,「有时雪茄只是雪茄」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"sometimes a cigar is just a cigar"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.25,1:02:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你不会介意我…留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you won't mind if I keep this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.64,1:02:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}one for myself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.70,1:02:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有件事 这个邪教有名字吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}One more thing Does the cult have a name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.92,1:02:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们自称为「冥界使徒」\N{\fnArial\fs30}They called themselves: "The Disciples of the Realm".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.27,1:03:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,又见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.62,1:03:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我可以帮你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anything I can help you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.93,1:03:08.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no no no I. I'm just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.03,1:03:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}just browsing really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.44,1:03:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现了一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just learned something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.09,1:03:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很不会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a terrible liar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.60,1:03:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要找什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it you're looking for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.29,1:03:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还是改天再来吧 - 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe I'll come back. - Mia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.85,1:03:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我岁数大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.26,1:03:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以没多少事情能吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that there's very little that surprises me anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.52,1:03:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便有 我也懒得表现出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if it does I'm too tired to show it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.05,1:03:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你要告诉我吗？还是我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now Are you gonna tell me? Or are we just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.14,1:03:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们家在被一个…一个鬼魂纠缠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think my family is being haunted by a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.03,1:03:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四排 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}AIsle four Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.78,1:03:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道听上去很扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…I know it sounds crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.31,1:03:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个女孩的鬼魂缠着我们 但是我…我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ghost of this girl haunting us. But I… I just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.13,1:03:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比分开红海更扯的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No crazier than the red sea parting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.89,1:03:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对没信仰的人来说 全都很扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}To non-believers it's all crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.53,1:03:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信这种东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you believe in this stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.43,1:04:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.35,1:04:04.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子有过一两次经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had one or two experiences in my life that eh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.12,1:04:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我什么都能接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}helped me to keep an open mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.48,1:04:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不认为你所碰到的 是那个女孩的鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't particularly think what you are experiencing is the ghost of that girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.58,1:04:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.63,1:04:24.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,鬼会徘徊在一些特别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well ghosts haunts specific places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.69,1:04:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常都发生过可怕的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually where something terrible has happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.61,1:04:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如你们过去的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your old house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.16,1:04:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…搬家了 可还是会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… We moved and it's still happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.09,1:04:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才不认为是鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I don't think it's a ghost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.80,1:04:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是那个邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now that cult…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.85,1:04:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说他们是想召唤什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said that they were trying to summon something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.67,1:04:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据我曾看到过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I've read in the past…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.11,1:04:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些邪教不是召唤鬼魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}These cults they don't summon ghosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.82,1:04:50.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是召唤人的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}They summon in human spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.77,1:04:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,肉身里从不曾存在的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something that has never existed in the flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.78,1:04:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.26,1:04:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想要怎样呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What… What do they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.21,1:05:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}A soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.58,1:05:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且不达目的不罢休\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they won't stop until they get one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.05,1:05:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该 我该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do I… What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.23,1:05:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这些书中能找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully the answer is in one of these books.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.55,1:05:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我女儿 露比\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughter Ruby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.06,1:05:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在你这个岁数去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She passed away when she was about your age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.94,1:05:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.02,1:05:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去她 我觉得生无可恋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without her I felt like I had nothing else to live for so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.40,1:05:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,但就在我等着一切结束的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But as I lay there waiting for it all to end…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.92,1:05:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到她的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard her voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.51,1:05:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 我的时候未到\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me that it wasn't my time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.71,1:06:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝对我另有安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}That God had another purpose for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.52,1:06:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也有你的安排 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too have a purpose Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.50,1:06:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To protect your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.99,1:06:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以不要认为自己这样做是发疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't think you're crazy for trying to do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.71,1:06:12.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是做你认为对的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you think is right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.18,1:06:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do what you have to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.41,1:07:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼专门折磨软弱和脆弱之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil preys on the weak and the vulnerable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.49,1:07:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图吞噬他们的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeking to devour their souls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.06,1:07:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,施展…魔咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}To perform… Incantations…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.10,1:07:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,洒下近亲之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spilling the blood of kin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.27,1:07:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,洒下纯洁之血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spilling the blood of the innocent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.27,1:07:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该如何阻止？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I stop it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.08,1:09:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.12,1:09:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.96,1:09:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.43,1:10:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.90,1:10:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？你得想想办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happened? You gotta help this travesty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.99,1:10:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你前来 神父 - 没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you for coming Father. - Yes. Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.85,1:10:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.93,1:10:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个娃娃 我能看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Doll May I see it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.89,1:11:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰丢掉过 - 或者说曾经试图\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John got rid of her. - Or tried to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.51,1:11:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她却出现在我们某个箱子的最下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There she was at the bottom of one of our last boxes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.34,1:11:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是不明白娃娃跟这个所谓的魔鬼有什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still don't understand what the doll has to with this supposed demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.71,1:11:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔有时可以利用物体作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons can sometimes use objects as conduits{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.76,1:11:50.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,达到其需求目标的渠道\N{\fnArial\fs30}to achieve their desired goal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.35,1:11:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,需求目标？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their desired goal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.79,1:11:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的灵魂 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our souls John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.17,1:11:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以它会来找丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why it's after Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.07,1:12:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它想要她的灵魂 - 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It wants her soul. - No no no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.05,1:12:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔不能随便夺走人的灵魂 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons can't just take souls Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.81,1:12:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂需要先献给魔鬼 才可能被其带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The soul needs to be offered to the demon before it can take it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.34,1:12:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我暂时还不打算把显出我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well I don't plan on offering my soul anytime soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.03,1:12:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔鬼就是撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Devil is the father of lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.50,1:12:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔是他的操控者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons are his manipulators.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.94,1:12:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人会想献出自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one ever plans to offer their soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.35,1:12:22.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么摆脱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can we get rid of it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.45,1:12:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,该如何阻止它再来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we stop it from coming back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.00,1:12:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前我还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know Not yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.01,1:12:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但教会有人或许懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}But someone at the church might.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.97,1:12:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,起码我听说有一对夫妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the very least I've heard of a married couple{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.98,1:12:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去曾经和教会合作过\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the church has worked with in the past{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.88,1:12:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,专门处理这种事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}that deal with this kind of thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.47,1:12:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在东部 不过总可以打个电话的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're back east but a call can always be placed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.03,1:12:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此期间 我们怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do in the meantime?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.83,1:12:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让丽娅再接近那个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have Leah anywhere near that doll.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.06,1:12:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me take her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.61,1:12:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许把她放在神圣的地方 会减弱恶魔的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps if she's stored in a sacred place it will weaken the demon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.32,1:12:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它没办法再回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't have the strength to return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.31,1:13:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 神父 - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you Father. - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.51,1:14:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你要上床睡觉 这是医嘱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Let's get you to bed Doctors orders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.28,1:14:06.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 约翰 我睡不着 除非我知道它不会再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no no John I can't Not until I know it's not coming back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.43,1:14:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 米娅 - 好了 那这样 这样…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mia. - Come on What if. what if…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.30,1:14:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 我做不到 - 我来守着她怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John I can't. - What if I just stayed up with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.01,1:14:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.01,1:14:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？ - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Alright? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.93,1:14:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.46,1:14:20.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.43,1:14:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.06,1:14:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for believing me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.72,1:14:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你会不会信我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if… if you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.63,1:14:31.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.34,1:14:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.21,1:14:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远都会相信你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will always believe you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.40,1:14:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.37,1:14:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得佩雷斯神父会帮我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think Father Perez is gonna help us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.88,1:14:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会的 我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.49,1:15:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.31,1:15:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,愿上帝垂怜你\N{\fnArial\fs30}May God have mercy on your soul!!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.27,1:17:17.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly Mia…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.61,1:17:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这与你无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's none of your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.45,1:17:23.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我和丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is between me and Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.29,1:17:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她想要那套睡衣\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she said she wanted those pajamas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.45,1:17:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会宠坏她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna spoil her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.75,1:17:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没机会当外婆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have a chance for grandkids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.06,1:17:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,再说孩子怎么充都不为过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides it's impossible to spoil a baby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.34,1:17:37.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if that's the truth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.27,1:17:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对丽娅 我们就要这么想 因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have to take that up with Leah because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.69,1:17:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她还指了这些裙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}she also pointed out these dresses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.99,1:17:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊芙林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh Evelyn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.74,1:18:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh sweetie-pie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.41,1:18:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哭得越来越凶 哎哟哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh it get's crazier Oh mommy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.50,1:18:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. You know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.76,1:18:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的露比以前也总是闹 直到我摇晃她\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Ruby used to fuzz and fuzz until I rocked her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.72,1:18:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put her down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.44,1:18:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,她以前就总是哭闹 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She used to fuzz and fuzz Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.96,1:18:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.22,1:18:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 丽娅 好 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right Leah Okay Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.61,1:18:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.14,1:18:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们摇晃着宝宝一整晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gonna rock that baby all night long{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.53,1:18:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是我的大救星\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a lifesaver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.85,1:18:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚哼唱的什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it that you were humming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.99,1:18:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个布鲁斯小调\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. A little blues ditty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.38,1:18:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的露比小时候 只有听到这个才会安静下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was the only thing that would settle my Ruby down when she was a baby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.20,1:19:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,介意我问下她是怎么去世的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if I ask how she passed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.33,1:19:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不想说 完全没问题的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't mind if. If you don't wanna talk about it…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.48,1:19:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 没什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.89,1:19:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为一场车祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a car accident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.93,1:19:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开车从我父母家回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were driving back from my parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.85,1:19:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们住在北边 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}They live up north. So eh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.72,1:19:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时很累 知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was tired. You know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.76,1:19:20.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,家人就是很累人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family'll do that to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.55,1:19:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天很晚了 我不该开车的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was very late and I shouldn't have been behind the wheel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.67,1:19:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last thing I remember was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.35,1:19:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时看向副驾驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking over in the passengers seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.77,1:19:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的女儿睡着了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At my daughter Asleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.51,1:19:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 她长成了最漂亮的小姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah She had grown into the most beautiful young woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.07,1:19:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周后我醒来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up three weeks later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.96,1:19:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可露比再也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Ruby never did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.16,1:19:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都没有机会和她告别\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get a chance to say goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.47,1:20:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有求上帝先带我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't get to beg god to take me first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.50,1:20:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我犯了错 可是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made the mistake and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.15,1:20:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,却让她付出了代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}She paid the price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.01,1:20:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.92,1:20:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.88,1:20:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？ - 那个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's what? - The doll…{\r}
