Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.43,1:21:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Evil…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.13,1:21:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.92,1:21:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw it John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.86,1:21:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.47,1:21:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉到了它有多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt how much it wants…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.50,1:21:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want's what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.06,1:21:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 带走她的灵魂 - 可你说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To take her soul. - But you said…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.95,1:21:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是不能带走丽娅的 你…你说要献给它才可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it can't take Leah's You. You said that it has to be offered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.99,1:21:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝宝是不能献出自己灵魂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A baby cannot offer its soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.93,1:21:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my god.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.50,1:21:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.16,1:21:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去看孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here I'll get that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.68,1:21:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Mia.{\r}
