Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.16,1:21:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰？ - 米娅 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John?! - Mia Mia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.20,1:22:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你马上离开房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to get out of the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.57,1:22:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I Ne…{\r}
