Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.88,1:23:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to come with me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.40,1:23:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要去找丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I need to find Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.62,1:23:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找她的 得先去教堂 他们会帮我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get her back. We need to get the church. They'll help us.{\r}
