Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.51,1:26:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give her back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.75,1:26:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.60,1:26:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.23,1:26:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.46,1:26:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.56,1:26:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.42,1:26:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah!{\r}
