Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.98,1:27:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soul…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.73,1:27:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soul…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.77,1:27:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your soul…{\r}
