Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.01,1:28:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy's coming…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.72,1:29:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.12,1:29:05.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她在里面 我进不去 - 米娅 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's in there I can't get in. - Mia! MIA!{\r}
