Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.96,1:29:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,丽娅需要你 好吗 亲爱的 我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leah needs you here Okay sweetie? I need you here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.79,1:29:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,请不要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.21,1:29:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.82,1:29:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.16,1:29:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会照顾好我们的丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll take good care of our Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.93,1:29:55.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你每晚都会亲吻她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kiss her every night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.32,1:29:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,等她长大了 约翰 告诉她我很爱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}When she's old enough John you tell her that I loved her.{\r}
