Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.48,1:30:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.52,1:30:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停下 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.36,1:30:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 它要她的灵魂 - 米娅 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John It wants her soul. - Mia Stop Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.49,1:30:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}My baby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.53,1:30:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,米娅 听他的话 你不能这么对丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mia Listen to him You can't do this to Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.38,1:30:19.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 女儿需要她的妈妈 - 你说它需要一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A daughter needs her mother. - You said it needs a soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.54,1:30:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过它需要一个灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said it needs a soul!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.00,1:30:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样 - 请让我救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please… - Please let me save her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.38,1:30:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会想这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna do this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.92,1:30:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 冷静 停下 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop stop stop! - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.24,1:30:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过你会救她的 你说过你会先救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you'd save her. You said you'd save her before me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.29,1:30:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你答应过的 - 想想我们的孩子 想想丽娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You promised… - Think about our baby. Think about Leah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.80,1:30:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？想想她 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Think about her Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.19,1:30:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要这么对我们 - 它要她的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do this to us! - It wants her soul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.29,1:30:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定有别的办法的 - 有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There has to be another way. - There is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.13,1:30:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以挽回一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make it right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.15,1:30:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是露比的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what Ruby meant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.20,1:30:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh No no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.76,1:31:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝重视牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}God honors sacrifice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.10,1:31:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的牺牲会打动上帝的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}And our sacrifices touch Gods heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.13,1:31:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,感动他的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And move his hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.58,1:31:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣说 这是我的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus said: This is my commandment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.00,1:31:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,要像我爱你般爱彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you love one another as I have loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.91,1:31:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有比这更伟大的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greater love hath no-one but this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.56,1:31:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为朋友舍命\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he lay down his life for his friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.16,1:31:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来祷告吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us pray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.81,1:32:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很精彩的布道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wonderful sermon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.44,1:32:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你精神不错 神父 - 谢谢 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You look well father! - Thank you Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.21,1:32:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.65,1:32:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在好多了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing much better now. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.36,1:32:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个娃娃有消息吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has there been any sign of the doll?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.30,1:32:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 从那晚后就没有 我想是警察拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Not since that night I thought the police took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.14,1:32:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过克拉金警探那边没有记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Detective Clarkin has no record of it.{\r}
