Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.00,1:32:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法毁灭根本不存在的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot destroy what was never created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.97,1:32:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望不管是谁遇到了那个娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just pray that whomever comes into contact with the doll next{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.44,1:32:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会得到他们需要的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}gets the help they need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.02,1:32:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do we.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.11,1:32:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.32,1:32:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜 神父 - 拜 米娅\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye Father. - Bye Mia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.91,1:32:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我差点忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost forgot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.01,1:32:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮 谢谢你 神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh It's beautiful. Thank you father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.93,1:32:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝心中最美丽的杰作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The loveliest masterpiece at the heart of God…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.41,1:32:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是一个母亲的爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the love of a mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.64,1:32:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.47,1:33:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我可以帮你的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I can help you with?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.21,1:33:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想找样东西送我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just trying to find something for my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.48,1:33:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.97,1:33:36.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是护士 总是帮助他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a nurse. Always helping people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.81,1:33:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到处找 就想找这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We looked everywhere for one of these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.05,1:33:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没有找到过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never did find one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.56,1:33:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该是个收藏品\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a collectors item supposedly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.68,1:33:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们价格定得略高\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we prize it a little higher than the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.83,1:33:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我包起来吗？ - 是的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to ring it up? - Yes please.{\r}
